    "name": "APA Hotel Asakusa-Ekimae",
    "detail": "Great hotel to stay in Japan. It has it's own pro's and con's depending on what type of traveller you are: Pro's: Location is the best. From Narita this is just one ride using kesie line and metro subway is just a few walks away. Sensoji temple is also just a few minutes walk. A peaceful neighboorhood if you are not a fun of crowded places. Con's: The place is far from tokyo itself. If you are using JR pass you would still need to get a tokyo subway ticket since there is no JR station near the area. Overall this is a recommended hotel!!",
